   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The particles -lah and -kah",
     "texto": [
      "**-lah** attaches to a verb form to soften an instruction or add emphasis: **Jagalah lingkungan!** («Take care of the environment!»). **-kah** attaches to a word and marks or highlights a question: **Benarkah sungai itu tercemar?** («Is it true that the river is polluted?»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Conservation",
     "texto": [
      "**Pelestarian** is the conservation of something; **melestarikan** is to conserve it. **Mendaur ulang** means to recycle and **memilah** is to separate waste so it can be treated differently."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
